# Prisma / PostgreSQL

- Single schema: `prisma/schema.prisma`.
- Money as integer **cents** (`subtotalCents`, `totalCents`).
- Persist pricing snapshots on orders (`pricingSnapshot` JSON) so historical totals don’t drift.
- Use enums from the data-model spec (`OrderType`, `OrderStatus`, etc.).
- Migrations via `pnpm prisma migrate`; never hand-edit production DB as the default path.
- Seed prices/printers for local dev; don’t hardcode prices in UI components.
